<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Sets the direction the object oTarget is currently facing in degrees. The direction
an object is facing is expressed as an incrementing clockwise degree value
starting from the south. Related constants are: DIRECTION_NORTH, DIRECTION_EAST,
DIRECTION_SOUTH and DIRECTION_WEST.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>If the specified object is invalid or does not have an orientation then the function will fail.
</p><p><br />
